@tool
class_name TransvoxelTables
extends RefCounted
# OWNS:       Transvoxel triangulation per cell case: regular (Marching Cubes) and transition cells.
# DEPENDS:    nothing
# INVARIANTS: Flattened from Transvoxel.cpp (github.com/EricLengyel/Transvoxel): per case, the
#             class triangulation with each vertex index replaced by its edge code 0xAB, where A < B
#             are the sample indices of the edge it lies on. 3 codes per triangle. Every triangle is
#             reversed from the source (inverse transition classes are reversed there first), so
#             front faces are clockwise seen from the air side, as Godot expects.
# GOTCHAS:    REGULAR sample i sits at (i & 1, i >> 1 & 1, i >> 2 & 1); bit i of the case is set
#             when it is solid. TRANSITION samples 0..8 lie on the full resolution face at half cell
#             steps (i % 3 along u, i / 3 along v); 9, 10, 11, 12 on the half resolution face at the
#             positions of 0, 2, 6, 8 with the same values. Case bit k is set when sample
#             TRANSITION_CASE_SAMPLES[k] is solid. u x v must point from the full resolution face
#             into the coarse cell, or the winding flips. No edge joins a full and a half resolution
#             sample. Watertight against REGULAR on both sides, checked offline with random fields.
